<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Qoronttosa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Qoronttosa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossa shenen Yesus Kiristoosas kiitistanas xeygetida Phawulosapene nu isha Sostinosape, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qoronttosan diza Xoossa woossa keethas, Goda Yesus Kiristoosas duma keezidaytasine isttasara nuusara Goda gidida Goda Yesus Kiristoosa suntha awan awanka xeygiza ammanizaytara gidanas xeygetida asa wursos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu Aawa Xoossafe Goda Yesus Kiristoosape kiyatethine saroy intes gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossas galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Goda Yesus Kiristoosa baggara intes imetida Xoossa kiyatetha gishshi wurso wode inte gishshika ta Xoossu galatays. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gaasoyka ay yoonka, hessikka hasa7an gidin eratetha wurson inte duretidista. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kiristoosa gishshi nu intes markattidayssi inte achchan minnides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi inte Yessus Kiristoosay qonccana gallas naagishin ayana imotethatape aykoka intes paccena. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Goda Yesus Kiristoosa nam7antho yaana gallasan inte inte bolla boroy bayinda beettana mala wursethi gakanas izi intena lo7ethi naagana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Izi ba naaza nu Goda Yesus Kiristoosa issipetethako intena xeygida Xoossi izi ammanetida Xoossukko.</para>
  <para style="s">Qoronttosa woossa keeththa garisa medhetida shaaketeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ta ishato! inte garisan shaaketethi doontta mala intes issi wozinayne issi qofay daana mala inte inte garisan issino gidana mala Goda Yesus Kiristoosa sunthan ta intena woossays. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte garisan palamay dizayssa ta Qalo7i so asape siyadis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yoozika hayssa malakko; Inte garisan issi issi asati ta Phawulosa baggakko gees; baggay qasse ta Aphilosa baggakko gees; baggay qasse ta keefa baggakko gishin haray qasse ta Kiristoosa baggaakko gees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">keefa guus Phixirosa guussukko </char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Histiko Kiristoosay shaaketi wodhidee? Inte gishshi Phawulosay kaqettidee? Woyko Phawulosa sunthan xamaqetidetii? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte giddofe Qarsoxxosapene Gayiyosape attin hara oonaka ta xamaqontta gishshi Xoossa galatays. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi oonikka “Ta Phawulosa sunthan xamaqistadis” gaana asi deena. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tumuka Isxxifanose so asa xamaqadis. Heytape hara ta xamaqidakone ta eriza uray deena. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kiristoosay tana kiitiday mishiracho qaala yootanas attin xamaqanas gidena. Kiristoosa masiqaley hada gidontta mala ta asape gidida cinccatethan sabakikke.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossa wolqane erateth gidida Kiristoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Masiqaleza kiitay dhayana dizaytas eeyatethikko. Gido attin attana diza nuusu gidiko Xoossa wolqakko. <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Cinccata cinccateth ta issitafe dhaysana; eranchata eratetha ta hada oothana” geeteti geesha maxaafan xaafettides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Cinccay awan dizee? Tamarida eray awan dizee? Hayssa wodeza piligi erizay awan dizee? Xoossi ha alameza erateth eeyatethan kessibeynee? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xoossa eratethafe dendidayssan alamey ba eratetha giddon Xoossu eroy xoonin sabako eeyatethan ammanizayta ashshanas Xoossa shene gidides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ay wodeka Ayhudati duma malata koyettes. Girike asati qasse erateth koyettes. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nuna gidiko kaqetida Kiristoosa sabakosu. Hessika Ayhudatas dhuphekko. Hanko ammanontta deretas qasse eeyatethikko. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Xoossi xeygidaytas istti Ayhudista gidin woykko Girike dere asa gidikkoka Kiristoosay Xoossa wolqane Xoossa eratethikko. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gaasoyka asa erape Xoossa eeyatethi aadhida eratethikko. Asa minotethafe Xoossa laafatethi aadhes. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ta ishato kase inte xeygetiza wode inte ay mala asakkone ane qopite. Asa qofa mala gidiko intefe darizayti erata gidekista. Intefe daroti waolqqay bayindaytakko. Darotikka gita keeththa asape yeletibeykkista. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gido attin Xoossi erata yeelachanas derape eeyata doorides. Xoossi minota yeelachanas alamezape daburanchata doorides. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Xoossi hanko ammanontta asa achan deettes geeteti erettiza miishata bayinda miisha mala oothana hayssa alamezan leqettidaytane kawuyidayta hada milatizayta doorides. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessika izi oothiday oonkka iza sinthan ceeqetontta malakko. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Intena qasse Xoossi Yesus Kiristoosara issifetethi deyana mala oothides. Hessa gishshi Xooss Yesus Kiristoosa nu erateth, nu xiilloteth, nu geeshatethine nuna ashshizade gidana mala oothides. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hesa gishshi kase “Ceeqiza uray Godan ceeqo” geeteti geesha maxaafan xaafetida malakko.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kaqettida Kiristoosa gishshi tamariso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato ta inteko Xoossa xuura qonccisana biday taas duuna qaratethi woykko era daroy diza gishshi gidena. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta inte giddon diza wode kaqettida Yesus Kiristoosape attin hara erontta mala ta baggara muritadis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ta inteko daro daaburan, yashatethanine qassekka daro kokorashe badis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta qaalayne sabakoyka ayana wolqa qonccisethanpe attin cimonine era daron gidena. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessika inte ammanoy Xoossa wolqanpe attin asa cinccatetha bolla xaphontta mala hanides.</para>
  <para style="s">Xiillo ayanape imettida erateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu kaha kunthida asata achchan era hasa7a hasa7osu. Gido attin hayssa ha alameza erateth gidena. Woyko dhayana diza ha alameza haarizayta erateth gidena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gido attin nu hasa7izay kase qoteti diza Xoossa xuura eratethikko. He eratethay Xoossi daro wodepe kase nuna bonchos kasetid wursi wothidayssakko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ha alameza haarizaytape oonka ha eratetha eribeyna. Eridako istti boncho Goda kaqettena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gido attin geesha maxaafan “Asa ayfey beyonttazi, asa haythi siyonttazi, asa wozinayka qoponttazi Xoossi ba dosizaytas giigisides” gees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossi gidiko hessa ba ayana baggara nuusu qonccisides. Ayanayka Xoossas ciima yoo ashontta wursi piligi xeeles. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asa garisan izades diza ayanape attin izade wozina erizay oonee? Hessaththoka Xoossa ayanape attin Xoossa qofa erizay oonka deena. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Xoossafe nuusu imettidayssa nuni erana mala Xoossa ayanay nuusu imettides attin nuni hayssa ha alameza ayana ekibeykko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu yootizay hayssako. Nu asape tamarda qaala gidontta ayanape tamarda qaala hasa7osu. Ayana tumatethaka nu qonccisizay ayana qaalankko. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossa ayanay izan bayinda asi Xoossa ayanape gididazi ekkanas danda7ena. Gaasoyka hessa mala yooy izas eeyatethakko. Izi bess ayanan paacetizade gidida gishshi izi eranas danda7ena. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Xoossa ayanay izan diza uray qass wursika paaces attin bess oonankka paacetena. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessikka “Goda qofa eranas danda7izay oonee? Iza zoranas danda7izay oonee?” geeteti kase geesha maxaafan xaafettida malakko. Nuusu gidiko Kiristoosa wozinay dees.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Woossa keeththa giddon medhettida shaaketeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato ta intena inte Kiristoosan buro guutha nayta malane buro ammanoy gelontta asa malape attin ayanan kumida asa mala gaada intes hasa7anas danda7abeyke. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte buro minnontta gishshi ta intena maathi paahadis attin buro mino kathi muzabeykke. Ha7ika gidiko inte burokko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inte ha7ika buro ammanon minnonttayta gidida gishshi inte giddon qanatetethine palamay dees. Histin inte buro ammanon minnontta asa mala gidiketii? Inte oothoy coo mela asi oothizayssa mala gidenee? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gaasoyka inte garisafe issay &lt;Ta Phawulosayssa” hankoys qass “Ta Aphilosayssa” giiko inte coo asho qofan xalala diza asa mala gideketii? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ero gido shin Aphilosay aazee? Phawulosayka aazee? Istti Goday isttas issas issas immida mala oothiza oothanchatakko. Inteka istta baggara ammanidista. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ta tokadis; Apholsay haathi ushshids; dichchday gidiko Xoossukko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi dichchizay Xoossu attin tokizadeyka, Haathe ushshizadeyka aykoka gidetena. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tokizade gidin woykko ushshizade gidin istti issinokko. Isttafe issadey issadey ba ootho mala woyto ekkana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gaasoyka nu Xoossara issife oothizaytakko. Inteka Xoossa goosha gadene Xoossa keethatakko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossafe taas imettida imotetha gina Keethe keexxiza hiilla mala keethay eqanas lo7etha giigisadis. Iza bolla hara uray keeththa keexxana. Gido attin keeththa keexxizadey wostti keexanakone naagistanas besses. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gaasoyka keethay keexxeteth oykettidape guye hara wothi qass keexxana danda7iza uray oonka baawa. Hessika keethas koyroy Yesus Kiristoosakko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Oonka keethay koyro keexxetidayssa bolla worqqan woykko biran bonchetida shuchchan woykko miththanine maatan woykko maqan keexxiko, <verse number="13" style="v"/>Izade oothoy ay malakone pirda gallas qonccana. Gasoyka he gallasay iza gede po7oy dizaso ehana. He oothoy taman paacistana gishshi issi issi ura oothoy ay malakone buro taman paacistaana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Oonka keexxida keethi minni eqiza gidiko hessaadey ba woyto ekkana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iza oothoy xuugettizadey gidiko woytoy izas deena shin izaadey ba hu7es attana. Gido attin izaade atethi tamape asi waaydi attiza atetha mala gidana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte inte hu7es Xoossa woossa keethe gididayssane Xoossa ayanay inte giddon dizayssa ereketii? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Oonka Xoossa woossa keeth laalliko Xooss izaade laallana. Xoossa woossa keethi geeshikko. Hessika intenakko. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Oonka berka bena balethofo. Intefe oonka hayssa ha alamezan bena erancha mala qopiko izadey erancha gidana mala bena berka eeya mala qoodo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hayssa ha dereza eratethi Xoossa achchan eeyatethikko. Kase geesha maxaafan “Izi eranchata istta gene ootho geedon zaaridi oykkana” geeteti xaafettides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Qasseka harason “Eranchata qofay mela hada gididayssa Goday erees” geeteti xaafetides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi wurka intes gidida gishshi oonka asan ceeqetofo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Phawulosa gidin Aphlosa gidin woykko kefa gidin alame gidin deyo gidin woykko hayqo gidin ha7i dizazi gidin woykko buro yaana miish gidin wurka intesikko. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Inteka Kiristoosaytakko; Kiristoosayka Xoossissakko.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristoosa Hawarista</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gidida gishshi asi wurikka nuna Kiristoosa oothanchata malane Xoossa xuura qonccisanas hadara ekkida asa mala qoodanas besses. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hadara ekidaytika ammanettidayta gidanas besses. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu bolla inte piridinka woykko duulata asay piridinka ta baggara taas aykoy baawa. Haray attoshin tarka ta bolla piridike. <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Ta eriza mala ta ta wozinara sidhiza miishi baawa; gido attin hessa guusi ta bolla mooroy baawa” guusu gidena. Buro ta bolla piridanay Godakko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi piridana wodey gakontta haara ay yooka piridofite. Goday yaana gakkanaas naagite. Izi dhuma giddon qotetidayssa buro qoncce kessana. Asa wozina giddon diza qofaka qoncce kessana. He wode issi issi uray bees bessiza galata Xoossa achafe ekkana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta ishato ta intena go7ana mala ha yoozan tanane Aphilossa intes leemuso shiishadis. Ta hayssa oothiday “Xaafetidayssafe aadhofa” gizayssa inte nuupe tamarana mala gaadakko. Hessa gishshi inte issade sabbidi hara uraa kadhanas bessena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neni aazan adhazii? Neni harape ekkontta attida miishi aazee? Histin ne wursaka ekkiday hara urape gidiko, hara urape ekkontta asa mala aazas ceeqistazii? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ha7i gidiko intes koshizazi inte wursi demidistane duretidista; nuupeka shaaketidi kawotidista. Inte tumuka kawotidako nuka intenara kawotanako shin. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gaasoyka Xoossi nuna Hawarista nu bolla hayqo piriday piridetida asata mala asa wursofe wursethi oothidazi taas milates. Hessa gishshi alames, kiitanchatasine asa wursos kaasa miish gididosu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nu Kiristoosa gishshi eeyata gididosu. Inte qass Kiristoosan eranchatakko. Nuni daburanchata, inte gidiko minotakko. Inte bonchetidayta; nuni gidiko kawushatakko. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hano gakanas nu gafosu; samotosu; kallotosu; buketosu; aqizaasoy dhayin wayetosu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu kushera oothi daaburi aqosu. Nuna qangishin nu qass anjosu; Nuna goodishin nu danda7osu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu sunthu istti moorishin nu qass lo7o zaarosu; Hano gakanas nu biittafe piitetida buura gididosu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta hayssa intes xaafizay intena ta dosiza ta nayta mala zoranas gaada attin intena yeelachanas gidena. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Intena Kiristoosan dichiza daro asati diikoka intes daro Aawati deettena. Tani qass Yesus Kiristoosa mishiracho qaalan yeladis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi inte tana milatana mala ta intena woossays. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Godan daro dosetidayssane ammanetida ta na Xintossa ta inteko kiittiday hessa gaasonkko. Izika duma duma son diza woossa keeththa asa wursi ta tamarisida timirttezara gaggizayssa Yesus Kiristoosan diza deyo oge gishshi intena izi qofisana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Intefe issi issi asati ta nam7antho intena beyanas bonttazi isttas milatin otoretida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gido attin Goda shene gidiko matara ta inteko baana. Hee baada he otoranchati hasa7izazi xalala gidontta isttas aaza wolqay dizakone beyana koyayss. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gaasoyka Xoossa kawotethi coo duuna xalala gidontta duunape bollara Xoossa wolqakko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ero inte koyzay awaysee? Durqqa ekka boyee? woykko siiqorane ashiketetha ayanara boo?</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Woossa keeththan yelachiza nagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Inte garisan yeelachiza laymmay dizaysi woretees. Hessa mala tunatethi ammanontta dereta achanka deena. Be Aawa machcho ekkida asi intekon dees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Histin hessa mala yeelchiza miishe inte giddon dishin aazas otoretetii? Hessafe hessa he yoozan inte muuzotanas intena bessenee? Hessa mala oothidade inte garisafe diggite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ta intenara ashon issife dontta agikoka ayanan qass intenara days. Ta ha7i intenara diza mala hessa oothidade bolla piridadis. <verse number="4-5" style="v"/>Inte shiiqizason ta intenara diza gishshi Goda Yesusa sunthanine inte giddon diza nu Goda Yesusa wolqan he moorancha ashoy dhayn iza shempoy Goda gallasan attana mala hessa mala asi xala7es aadhi imetto. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inte ceeqetizayss lo7os gidena. Guutha irishoy daro bukaysso denthethiza erekketii? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Inte ha7i irishoy bayinda ooratha bukaysso gidana mala kase caala irishoza inte giddofe diigite. Nu paziga dorisu gidida Kiristoosay nuusu yarshettides. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">paziga bonchiza wode asay caala irisho gidida miishi kaathan yegena </char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ane nuni paziga ba7alaza qohoyne iittatethi izan kumida kase caala irisho bolla gidontta irishoy bayinda ukethan suuretethanine tuman bonchosu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Intes laymmatiza asatara issifetethi dontta mala ta intes kase dabiddabe xaafadisikoshin. <verse number="10-11" style="v"/>Inte mela ammanontta laymmatiza asara gidontta woykko coo gaphigaphizaytara, kayssotizaytara, eeqas goynizaytara gaagopite guusu gidontta dishin ha7i ta xaafiday ammanayss gishshe laymmatizaytassara woykko mathotizaytara, gaphigaphizaytara, eeqas goynizaytara, asa sunthu moorizaytara woykko cayzaytara, asa miishe bonqizadentara intes issifeteth doopo” ga xaafadis. Heytantta malara haray atto shin kathika issife moppite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hanko ammanontta asa bolla piridanas tana aazi gathizee? Woossa keeththan dizayta bolla inte pirideketii? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Woossa keethafe karera dizayta bolla gidiko Xoossi piridana “Inte inte giddofe iitta ura diigite” geeteti geesha maxaafan xaafettides.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ammanizayti ba garisan mootistanas bessena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Inte garisafe issades hara ammanizadera yooy diiko he yooza ammanizayta achchi shiishanayssa wostti ammanontta asa sinthan piridistana shiishizee? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ammaniza asay ammanontta asa bolla piridanayssa inte ereketii? Inte buro alame bolla piridandetta. Gidiko hessa guutha yoo bolla piridanas danda7eketii? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hayssa biitta bolla diza piriday attoshin inte buro kiitanchata bolla piridanayssa ereketii? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inte inte garisan oyettiko ammanizayta maabarape karen dizaytanine kadhettida asata sinthan wostti inte yoyo shiishetii? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ta hessa intes gizay intena yeelachanaskko. Inte garisan ammanizayta giigisanas danda7iza wozanama asi bayee? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido attin ammanizadey hara ammanizade mootanas alame pirida keethe baanas bessizee? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Inte garisan issay issa mootoy inte kundethas malata besses. Inte qohanape qohettiko lo7enee? Qasseka inte asi balethanape intena asi balethiko lo7enee? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte haa qohistanape gede qoheistane balethista. Hessikka inte ishatakko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Makal7anchati Xoossa kawoteth gelonttayssa ereketii? Hessa mala yoon baletopite. Laymmatana qaqatizayti, eeqqa eqqizaytine addey addera laymmatizayti, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Woyko kaysoti, gaphigaphizayti, mathotizayti, asi cayzaytine bonqizayti Xoossa kawoteth laatetena. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Intefe issi issi asati heytantta malako shin ha7i qass Goda Yesus Kiristoosa sunthanine nu sunthanine nu Xoossa ayanan mecettidista, dummatidistane xiillidista.</para>
  <para style="s">Be asatethan Xoossu boncho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Haray wurikka taas immetides. Gido attin wurikka go7izaz gidena. Wurika taas immetides gido attin ay miishika tana haarena <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qasse Kaathi uloskko; uloyka kaththaskko. Gido attin Xoossi nam7aka dhayssana. Asatethi Godassife attin laymmas gidena. Godayka asatethaskko. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossi Goda hayqope denthida mala nunaka qasse ba wolqan hayqope denthana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inte asatethay Kiristoosa asatetha billite gididayssa inte ereketii? Histin ta Kiristoosa asatethafe issa laymman aqqiza asatara issino histoo? Muleka bessena. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Woyko laymmatizarira aqqizadey izira issi asho gidizayssa inte ereketii? “Nam7ay issi asho gidetes” geetetides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Gido attin Godara issino gidizadey izara issi ayana gidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Laymmape hakkite. Asi oothiza hara nagaray wuri izade ashope karera hanes. laymma laymmatizadey gidiko berika ba asatetha bolla nagara oothes. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Inte asatethay inte gaathan diza xiillo ayanas duussaso gididayssa inte erekketii? He ayanayka inte Xoossafe ekoyssakko. Inteka inte intes gidekista. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Inte miishan shametidista. Hessa gishshi inte inte asatethan Xoossu bonchite.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ekko gishshine gello gishshi shiiqida oychone zaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v"/>Inte taas xaafida mala asi macashako gakontta aggizako lo7okko. Gido attin laymmape naagistanas atuma asas issas issas macha du. Macashas issineys issineys azinay do. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Azinay ba machcheys koshizaz wursi ootho. Machaka ba azinas koshizazi ubbaa oothu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Machi asatethi izis xalala gidontta azinasara kotha. Hessaththoka azina asatethi izas xalala gidontta machcheyssara kotha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nam7ay dosan woossas giidi zoren gido giidi qachida gallasatape attin hara gallas issay issas akaye goopite. Hessa geedon intes intena haaroy xoonin xala7ey intena paccontta mala nam7ay issife aqqite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ta hessa gizay coo azazo mala gidontta zore zorays. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Asi wuri ta mala machcho ekontta dizako ta dosayss. Gido attin issi issi asas Xoossafe imettida duma imotay dees. Issas duma issi imotay dees. Hankoyssas qass hara imotay dees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Buro ekonttaytane gelonttayta gishshi qasseka azinay hayqida macashata gishshi ta gizay istti gelonttane ekontta ta mala dizako isttas lo7o gayss. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gido attin istti bena naaganas danda7onttayta gidiko geleton eketon Coo amon xuugistanape ekoyne geloy lo7o. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ekidaytasine gelidaytas ta immiza azazoy hayssakko. Hiskka Goda azazope attin ta azazo gidena. Azina gelida machcheya ba azinape shaaketufu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shaaketiza gidiko hara azina gelontta uttu. Akaye giiko ba azinara giigu. Azinayka ba machcho anjji yeddofo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hanko asas qass ta hizgays. Hessa gizayka tana attin Goda gidena. Ammanontta macha diza ammanizadey machcheya izara daana dosikko izi izo anjjanas bessena. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ammanontta azinay diza ammaniza maccashiya he ammanontta azinay izira daanas koyko iza izape anjjista baanas izis bessena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Gaasoyka ammanontta azinay ammaniza ba machcheyin anjjetes. Ammanontta maccashayaka ammaniza ba azinan anjjistawus. Hessatho hanontta aggiko inte yelida nayti tunata gidana shin ha7i qass anjjetidaytakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gido attin nam7afe issay ammanonttadey shaakistana koyko shaaketo. Adde gidin macca gidin ammanizadey hessa mala wogan qachetena. Xoossi nuna saron daana mala xeygides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hane ne ne azina ashanakone ay erazii? Woyko haysso ne ne machcho ashanakone ay erayii? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Coo issi issi ura Xoossi xeygida malane Goday wothida mala deyo. Woossa keethatas ta wothiza wogay hessako. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Issadey ammananape kase qaxaretidazi gidiko qaxaretontta asa mala hanopo. Qass qaxaretontta dishe ammanidadeyka qaxaretofo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Qaxaretin qaxaretontta aggin nam7ankka go7ay baawa. Wanna ayfe yoy Xoossa azazo polokko. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Issi issi uray ba xeygettida xeygetethan minni deyo. <verse number="21-22" style="v"/>Ammaniza wode ne aylee? Ne hessas daro metotopa; wozistana danda7iko wozista. Gaasoyka ayle gidi dishe Goda ammanidadey izi Goda goqakko. Hessaththoka ammaniza wode goqa gidonttadey izi Kiristoosas ayllekko. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Inte miishan shametidista. Hessa gishshi asa aylle gidopite. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta ishato intefe issi issi uray ba xeygetida mala Xoossara minni deyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Geela7ota, paanthata gishshine ammi7ista gishshi shiiqida oycho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gela7otane paanthata gishshi taas godape imettida azazoy deena. Gido attin Goda maarotethafe dendidayssan ta intes ammanetidade gidada intena zorays. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hayssa ha7i wode meto gaason inte ha7i diza mala dizako taas lo7o milates. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ne machidade gidiko anjjanas koyopa. Machonttade gidiko machcho ekkanas koyopa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Macho ekikoka nagara gidena. Gela7oyaka geliko nagara gidena. Gido attin ekkiza asati, gelizayti hayssa alameza bolla istta daro metoy gakkana. Ta qass hessi inte bolla gakontta aganayssa dosayss. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta ishato ta qofay hayssa malakko. wodezi qanthi gidida gishshi macha dizadey macha bayindade mala deyo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yekkizayti yekontta asa mala, ufa7ettizayti ufa7etontta asa mala gideto. Miishe shammidadentti shamettida miisha bess gi qopopeto. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hayssa alameza miishan go7etizayti wursi go7etontta asa mala gid deeto. Gaasoyka Hayssa alameza hanoy adhanas deess. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Inte hirigay bayinda daana mala ta koyays. Machonttadey Goda ufayssanas Goda gishshi qopees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Machidadey qass ba machchiyo ufayssanas hayssa alameza miishi qopees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hayssan iza qofay nam77u keezi shaaketes. Gelontta macashiya woykko gela7oya Godaz xalala qopaysu. Izis gita qofayka ashonkka, ayanankka Godas dumatethikko. Gelidara gidiko ba azina ufayssanas hayssa alameza hano xalala qopaysu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ta hessa gizay intes lo7anaz qopadape attin intena daro qofan yeganas gidena. Taas gita qofay inte wozinay shaaketi nam7u kezontta inte Godan minnidi wogara deyanaskko. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Issadey ba oychida gela7oyo wogara oykontta aggiko izi wodeyka ciimi ciimi bikko ekkana koyko ba koyda mala ekko. Ekikone geliko lo7okko. Nagara gidena. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Gido attin hayssa ha yoozan iza wozinay qaaxontta bena haridi gela7oyo ekkike giidi muritida uray lo7o oothides. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi gela7oyo ekidadey lo7o oothides. Ekonttadeyka adhetha lo7o oothides. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Issi macashi azinay paxxa diza wode kumethan ba azinara qachistadusu. Azinay hayqiko ba koyda ura gelana danda7aysu. Iza gelanadey ammanizade gido attin gelu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ta qofa mala gidiko iza gelontta dizako daro ufayssan deyandusu. Taasika tanan Xoossa ayanay diza milates.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Eeqas yarishetida asho muussa gishshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Eeqas shuketida asho gishshi inte taas xaafidayssa mala gidiko tumuka nu wurka eriza miishi dees. Eroy otorses; siiqoy qass go7es. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta erays giza asi eranas besiza mala buro eribeyna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossu siqiza uray gidiko izi Xoossa achan erettida de. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi eeqas yarishettida asho muussa gishshi ta intes gizay hayssa alamezan eeqay hada gididayssane issi Xoossafe attin hara Xoossi bayindayssa nu erosu. <verse number="5-6" style="v"/>Aydeka gidiko daro eeqatine daro godati deetes shin salon gidin biitta bolla xoossu geetettiza daro eeqati diikoka nuusu gidiko haniday wurikka izan hanides. Nuka izas gidida issi Xoossi Aaway dees. Qassekka hanidazi wurikka izan haniday nuka izan hanida issi Goday Yesus Kiristoosay xalala nuus dees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gido attin hessa asi wuri erena. Issi issi asati hano gakanas eeqqa goyno dosida gishshi hessa mala asho miishe addaka Eeqas shuketidayssa qopetes. Isttas qofay laafa gidida gishshi istti tunetes. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido attin Kathi nuna Xoossa achi gathena. Nu montta agikoka nuus paccizay deena. Nu mikokka nuusu wodhey deena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gido attin inte metoy bawa guusan oothizays ammanon minnontta asas dhuphe gidontta mala nagetite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ne hessa milatiza eratethi diza gishshi hinko ammanon minontta uray eeqa keeththan ne mizayssa beydi eeqas shuketidayssa manas xalenee? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Kiristoosay iza gishshi hayqida he ammanon minontta ishay ne eratetha gaason dhayes guskko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessaththoka inte inte ishata qohonine istta laafa qofa madunithon Kiristoosa qohista. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta miza miishi ta isha dhuphizazi gidiko ta isha ta dhuphethontta mala mulekka asho miike.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hawaristas diza shene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tani goqa asi gidikinaa? Ta Haware gidikinaa? Nu Goda Yesusa ta ta ayfera beyabeykinaa? Inteka Godan ta oothon bettida ayfe gideketii? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Haratas ta haware gidontta agikokka ta intes tumape hawarekko. Gaasoyka Godan ta Hawaretetha bessiza matamey intenako. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tana paccizaytas ta immiza malithey hessako. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ero maanasine uyanas nuusu bessenee? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hara Hawarista mala Goda ishata malane kefantta mala nuka ammaniza nu machcheta ekki yuuyana danda7okonii? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Woyko waayeti daburidi daanas bessizay tanane Barinabassa xalalaa? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ero ba miishara wotadarateth oothizay oonee? woyne miith tokidi, tokida miththa ayfe monttay oonee? Mehe hemmishe ba hemmiza meheza maath uyonttay oonee? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ta hayssa gizay coo asa qofa mala xalalaa? Muse wogay hessaththo genee? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Muse woga garisan “Kath bukiza mehe duuna qashofa” geeteti xaafetides. Histin Xoossu metiday he meheza qanthee? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Izi hessa giday tumape nu gishshi gidenee? He xaafetiday addafe nu gishshikko. Goshanchayne goyzay qassekka bukizaysika ba ootho ayfepe iza gakkizayssa ekanas ufayssan oothes. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nu inte gidon ayana zerethi zeridayti ashosu gidizaz maxiiko hessi gita miishee? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hara asati intefe hessa mala go7a ekanas danda7iko nu qass hessafe daro demmanas bessenee? Gido attin nuni nuusu bessiza mala go7etibeyko. Harapeka nu Kiristoosa mishiracho qaalas dhuphe gidontta mala hanizazi wursika danda7osu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xoossa woossa keeththan oothizayti ba maanayssa Xoossa woossa keethafe ekkizayssa mala yarshoson oothizaytika he ba oothiza yarishizayssafe mizayssa inte ereketii? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessaththoka mishiracho qaala sabakizayti bena koshizayssa mishiracho qaala oothizasope ekkana mala Goday woga wothides. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tani gidiko hessa wursopeka aykoka go7etabeyke. Ha7ika ta intes hayssa xaafizay heytantta mala miish taas ootheto gaada gidena. Ayis giiko oonikka tani ta Godan ceeqetizaro taape wothi ekanape taas hayqoy lo7okko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mishiracho qaala sabakidayssi tana ceeqisena. Ta sabakizay dosa gidida gishshi gidontta wolqara tana gakida gishshikko. Ta mishiracho qaala sabakontta aggiko tana aye! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mishiracho qaala ta dosan ta sabakiko taas woytoy dees. Tani ta dosan gidontta wolqara oothizayssa gidiko hadara polana mala ootho xalala gidana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Histin taas aaza woytoy dizee? Taas woytoy daanay mishiracho qaala sabakashe taas bessizayta ta go7etontta aggikkoko. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta goqape attin oonaskka ayleka gidike. Gido attin darota Godako zaarana gishshi asa wursos aylle mala gidadis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ayhudista ashanas Ayhudatara istta milatadis. Ta ta baggara Muse wogape garasara gidontta dashe Muse wogape garisara dizayta ashanas istta milatadis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ta ta baggara Xoossa wogay dizadene Kiristoosa wogas haaretizade gidikkoka wogay bayindayta ashanas istta mala wogay bayindade gidides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Daburanchata ashanas gaada taka daburanchatara istta mala taka daburancha gidadis. Taas danda7etida mala wurson issi issi asata ashanas asa wursora istti hanizaz hanadis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ta hayssa ubbaa oothizay mishiracho qaala anjjo isttara gishistanas mishiracho qaala gishshi oothadis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Gaade wothe woxxizayti daro shin xoonidi shilmmate demmizay issade xalala gididayssa inte ereketii? Hessa gishshi shilmmate ekanas woxxizade mala inteka woxxite. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gaaden wooxi adhdhanas gigettizadey oonka hano wurson berika bena naages. Heytanti adhdhanane dhayana akillile ekanas daburetes shin nu qass medhinas dhayontta akillile demmanas daburosu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akillile guus shulliza miishikko</char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta qass poloy bayinda coo mela woxxizade mala coo mela woxxike. Qasseka carikora baxxetizade mala coo mela gaden baxxetike. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ta qass haratas sabaka pe7ada taas kunda atontta mala ta asatetha shiisha oykada haarays.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Isiraa7eele nayta bolla gakkidayss gakkontta mala naageteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato kase nu Aawati shaaray isttafe bollara gididi kalethidayssa malane istti wurikka zo7o abba pinidayssa ta intena qopissanas koyayss. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Istti Musera gidanas giidi shaaranine abban xammaqitida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wurika issi ayana quma mida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wurika issi ayana ushshu uyida. Istti uydayka bena kaalliza ayana zaalafe pulitidayssafekko. He zaalayka Kiristoosakko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gido attin Xoossi darottan ufa7ettibeyna. Hessa gishshi istta ahay bazzon kundi attides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Istti iitta miish amotidayssatho nuka amotontta mala he istta hanoy nu naagistana mala nuusu lemuso gidides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Derey manasine uyanas uttides; Yexansika dendides” geeteti kase geesha maxaafan xaafetida mala istta garisafe issi issi asati oothoyssatho inteka eeqa goynizayta gidopite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Istta garisafe issi issi asati laymmatidi issi gallas nam7u tammane hedzdzu shi asay dippi gi wuroyssatho wurontta mala nuka ane laymmatoko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Istta garisafe issi issi asati Goda paccidine shoshan duketi hayqqi dhaydayssa mala nuka ane Goda paccoko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Istta garisafe issi issi asati zuzumetidi dhaysiza bocha kiittanchan dhaydayssatho inteka dhayontta mala zuzumopite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessi wuri nuusu lemuso gidana mala istta bolla gakides. Wode wursethan diza nuusu timirtte gidana mala nuusu xaafettides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta minna eqa days gizadey dikko kunidontta mala bessi naageto. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Asa bolla gakida paccepe hara aadhiza paccey inte bolla gakibeyna. Xoossi ammanetiza Xoossu gidida gishshi inte danda7ontta inte wolqafe bollara inte paccetena mala agagena. Gido attin inte paccetiza wode he pacceza inte danda7ana mala wolqa immidi paccepe inte kesi ekkana oge izi intes giigisana.</para>
  <para style="s">Eeqara issipetethi daanas bessena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta siiqoto! eeqas goynopite; izape hakkite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta intes hayssa gizay wozinama gidida gishshikko. Hessa gishshi ta yootizayssa ane inte interkka piridite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuni Xoossa galatidi ekkiza ushay Kiristoosa suuthara gagoy dizayssa gidenee? Hessaththoka nu bathi bathi gisheti miza ukethay Kiristoosa ashora gagoy dizayssa gidenee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ukethay issino gidida mala nunikka daro gidi uttidika wurikka issi ashokko. Nu wurikka issi ukethaza gisheti moosu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ane inte Isiraa7eele nayti oothidayssa qopite. Shiiqiza yarshozape mizaytas yarshoy shiiqizasora gagotethi denee? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Histin eeqas yarishetida yarsho gidin woykko eeqay ba baggara go7ara dees gazinaa? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gidena. Ammanontta asay shiishiza yarshoy Xoossas gidontta xala7eskko. Intes xala7e era issipetethi daana mala ta koyke. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xala7e ushshune Goda ushshu inte issife gathi uyana danda7ekista. Goda maadafene xala7e maadafe nam77afe gathi maana danda7ekista. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nuni Goda hanqethinoo? Nu izape minnizonii?</para>
  <para style="s">Wuriskka Xoossa bonchos ootho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wurika taas imettides shin wurikka tana go7izaz gidena. Wurika taas shin wurikka tana maadena. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Asi wurikka ba lage go7anaz gathi xeello attin bena go7anaz xalala koyopo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Giyan bayzetiza asho wursi sidhey bayinda miite. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Biittayne biitta bolla dizay wurikka Godayssakko. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ammanontta asi intena beso xeygidi shiishida kaththa wursi aykokka sidhontta miite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Gido attin issi uray “Hayssi eeqas yarishetida kathiko” giiko he kaatha, he ura qofa gishshine intena sidhisiko mopiite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta intes hessa gizay he yootidade qofa gishshi gadis attin inte qofa gishshi gabeyke. Ta xiillo gida dishin aazas hara ura qofa geedon ta bolla piridetizee? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ta Xoossu galatada mizade gida utada aazas hara uran piridetoo? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Histiko inte ay miikoka ay uykoka woykko aykoka oothiko wursika Xoossa bonchos oothite. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ayhuda asas gidin hanko dere asas gidin woykko Xoossa woossa keethas oonaskka dhuphe gidopite. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ta asi wursaka ay ogeraka ufayssana koyza mala inteka hessaththo oothite. Daroti attana mala ta tana go7izazi gidontta istta go7izaz koyays.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tani Kiristoosa milatada iza kaallizayssatho inteka tana milatidi kaallite.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossu goyno woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte taas wursi qopiza gishshine taape ekkida timirtteza lo7ethi oykida gishshi ta intena galatayss. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gido attin ta inte erana mala koyzay atumasas wursos hu7ey Kiristoosa gididayssa mala atumasay maccashas wursos hu7ekko. Qasse Xoossi Kiristoosas hu7ekko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Be hu7e guluntidi Xoossu woossizadey woykko qaala yootizadey oonikka berka bena kawushes. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Be hu7e goozontta woossiza maccashiya woykko tinbite qaala yootiza ay maccashika berka bena kawushaysu. Hessi iza ba hu7e bulissidadera ginakko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Maccashi ba hu7e goozontta aggiko meydetu woykko qanxxisu. Izis ba hu7e meydetethi woykko qanxxisethi yeelachizaz gidiko goozu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Addey ba hu7e gulunttanas bessena. Atumasi Xoossa lemusone Xoossa bonchokko. Maccashi gidiko addes bonchokko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gaasoyka maccashi addefe medhetadusu attin atumas maccashafe medhetibeyna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qasseka maccashi addes medhetadusu attin addey maccashas medhetibeyna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi kiittanchati beyanas naagiza macashas imettida maata bessiza goose ba hu7en goozu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Goda achchan gidiko maccashay addey bayinda, addeyka maccashay bayinda deyetena. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Maccashay addefe beetidayssatho addeyka maccashafe yelettes. Gido attin nam7ayka Xoossafe bettida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Maccashi ba hu7e goozontta Xoossu woossanas bessizakone ane inte piridite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Atumasi ba huye adusi dichiko boriso gididayssa intena medhetetha hanotethi erisuwee? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Maccash gidiko ba hu7e ithike dichiko hessi izis boncho gidenee? Izis adusa hu7e ithikey imettiday izis seelokko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi oonikka hayssa ha yoozan palamistana koyko nuusu gidinkka Xoossa woossa keethas hayssafe hara wogay deena.</para>
  <para style="s">Goda ka7o eko woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Inte issi so shiiqetiza wode qohosu attin go7as gidontta gishshi ta hayssa azazoza intes aathizay intena galatashe gidena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inte woossa keeththan shiiqiza wode inte garisan shaakotethi dizayssa ta kasista siyadis. Ta siyoyssafe baggay tumu gidanayssa ta ammanayss. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Inte giddofe tumanchati shaaketi eretana mala hessa mala shaakoy inte giddon daanayssi dossa gidena. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Inte issife shiiqetidi mizay Goda ka7o gidena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Inte shiiqetidi issay issa naagontta dishe kathi meista. Intefe issadey gafan dishin hankoyssi qass mathotes. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Histin intes uyanasine maanasoy bayee? Woyko Xoossa keeth leqqidi aykoyka bayindayta yeelachetii? Histin ta intena ay goo? Hayssa ha hanozas intena galatoo? Muleka galatike. <verse number="23-24" style="v"/>Ta Godape ekkidayssa intes aathadis. Hessika Goda Yesusay adhdhi imettida omaris uketh denthidine Xoossu galati bathidi “[Heyte! miite!] hayssi intes gidiza ta ashokko. Tana qopanas inte hayssa oothite” gides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessaththoka Ka7ope guye ushsha denthidi “Hayssi ushshay ta suuthan haniza ooratha caqqoko. Hessa gishshi ushshafe inte uyiza wode hayssa tana qopana mala oothite” gides. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Heyssa ukeetha inte miza wodene hayssa ushshaka uyiza wurso wode Goday yaana gakanas inte iza hayqo yotandista. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi oonka bessontta dishin hayssa uketha miiko woykko Goda ushsha uyiko izadey Goda ashone iza suutha kawushida gishshi izi oychistana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Oonka hayssa ha uketha manapene ushshafe uyanape kaseti berka bena pacco. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Gaasoyka oonka Goda asho bees gelontta dishin miikone Goda ushsha uykko izadey berika ba bolla pirida ehees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Inte garisan daro asay daburidayne saketiday qasseka baggay hayqiday hessa geedonkko. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nu nurka nuna paccizako nu bolla piridetenakoshin. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Gido attin Goday pirdiza wode nu hanko ammanontta asara piridetontta mala izi nuna kaseti murees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta ishato inte maana shiiqiza wode issay issara naagetite. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Inte shiiqiza shiiqoy pirdas gidontta mala intafe oonka gafidadey diiko kasetidi ba son mo. Hankko attidayssa hara wode inteko baada woga woththana</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xiillo ayanay immida imotata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato ayanay immiza imotetha gishshi inte issi miish erana mala ta koyays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte ammananape kase coo mela heene haane guussan inte erontta kaalethetidi duuna muume gidida eeqatako bidayssa inteka ereta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi oonikka Xoossa ayanan hasa7ishe “Yesusay qangettidade” geena. Hessaththoka xiillo ayanan gididi attin oonka “Yesusay Goda” gaana uray donttayssa ta intes yotays. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Asas imotethi duma duma gidishin ayanay gidiko issinokko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Oothoyka duma duma gidshin Goday gidiko issakko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Duma duma ootho ogeti diikoka wursika oothizay issi Xoossakko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gido attin xiillo ayana qoncciso imotay issades imetizay issife go7etanaskko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Issades hiillan hasa7ana eratethi imetees. Hara uras qass he ayananka eratetha qaalan hasa7ana qaalay imetees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Issades he ayanan ammanoy imetees. Hara uras qass he ayananka hargizayta pathiza imotay imetees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Issades malalithiza ootho oothiza imotay imetees. Qasseka hara uras buro tinbite hasa7ay; hara uras qasseka ayanata shaakki eroy; hara uras duma duma qaalan hasa7ey; qasseka hara uras hara duma duma qaalan hasaetidayssa birishana imotay imetees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heyti wurikka he issi ayanay immiza imota gidishin issi issi uras ba koyida mala imees.</para>
  <para style="s">Issi asatetha bolla duma duma biilliteti deettes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Issi asatetha bolla daro biilliteti diikoka asatethay issinokko. Gido attin biilliteti daro gidikkoka asatethay issino xalalakko. Kiristoosayka hessa malakko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ayhuda asata gidinka Girike asata gidinka, aylle gidinka woykko goqa asata gidinka nu wurikka issino gidanas issi ayanan xammaqetidosu. Nu wurikka ha issi ayanape uyidosu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asatethi medhettiday daro biillitistape attin issi biillitepe xalala gidena. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Toy “Ta kushe gidontta gishshi asatetha giddon diikke” giiko izi hizgida gishshi izas asatethan duusi attanee? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Heythi “Ta ayfe gidontta gishshi asatetha giddon diike” giiko hessa gishshi asatetha giddon duusi izas attanee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Asatethi wurikka ayfe xalala gididako aazan siyanee? Asatethi wurikka haythe xalala gididako aazan singanee? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Gido attin Xoossi issa issa ba koyda mala asatetha giddon daanas bessizason wothides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Biillitey wurikka issino gididako kumetha asatethi awape beistanee? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi biilliteti daro shin asatethi gidiko issino xalalakko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ayfey kushe “Nena ta koyke” gaanas danda7ena. Hu7ey to “Nena taas koshena” gaana danda7ena. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Haray attoshin wursofe laafa milatiza biilliteti daro koshshizaytakko. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nuni laafa gi leqqiza biillitista hankoytape aathi bonchosu. Qasseka nu isttan yeelatiza biillitista harape aathi naagosu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nu isttan yeelatontta biillitistas gidiko hessa mala boncho koshena. Xoossi gidiko asatetha biillitista issi bolla oythethidi bonchoy paccizaytas adhetha boncho immides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Izi hessa oothiday asatetha biillitista garisan shaakotethi doontta istti ba garisan issay issa benara gina gi qopanaskko. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Issi biillitey sakettiko hanko biilliteti wurikka izara issife sakettettes. Issi biillitey bonchetiko biilliteti wurikka issife ufa7etes. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Histiko inte wurikka Kiristoosa asatethikko. Inte issay issay iza asatetha biillitistakko. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Xoossi woossa keeththa giddon koyro hawarista, nam7antho qasse nabeta, hedzdzantho asttamarista, kaallethidi malata oothizayta, pathiza imotethi dizayta, harataka ase maadiza imotay dizayta, dere ayiso eratethi dizaytane duma duma qaala hasa7ana imotethi diza asata wothides. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wurika hawaratee? Wurika nabetee? Wurika asttamaretee? Wurika malalithiza miishe oothizoo? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Wurisoska hargizayta pathiza imotay dizee? Asi wurikka duma qaalan hasa7izee? Duma qaalan hasa7etoyssa asay wuri birshizee? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gido attin inte wurikka wursofe adhdhiza imoteth lo7ethi koyte. Qasseka hara wursofe adhdhiza oge ta intena bessana.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tumu siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta asa qaalanine salo kiittanchata qaalan hasa7ikoka taas siiqoy bayinda aggiko coo mela birata giiretha mala woykko daala giiretha malakko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tinbite hasa7iza imotay taas diikoka, woykko xuura yootane erateth ubbaa ta erikoka, zuma izi dizasope dhooqqada haraso digiza ammanoy taas diikoka hessa wursaka siiqoy bayinda ta oothiko mela hadakko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taas dizaz ubbaa ta manqqotas immikoka, ta asatetha ta taman xuugikoka, siiqoy bayinda aggiko tana ayne maadena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Siiqoy danda7akko qasseka kiya, siiqoy miqaynena, ceeqettena, otorettena, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bessonttaz oothena, berika ba go7a xalala xeelena. Qoho qoodan yegena. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Siiqoy tumanipe attin makali7an ufa7ettena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Siiqoy wurso wode danda7es. Wuriso wodeka ammanes. ufays oothesine minni eqees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Siiqoy muleka kundena. Tinbitey gidiko attana. Hara qaalan hasa7ayka attana. Eratethika shaaristana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gaasoyka nu erizay wursi gidontta shaakii erosu. Tinbite hasa7a gidikkoka bagga hasa7osu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gido attin wursethi gakkiza wode kumethi gidontta imotay he wode shaaristana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta guutha naatetethan dashe na mala hasa7ayssine na mala qopayss. Na malaka yuusha qopayss. Kaha kunthidape guye kase naatethan hanizayssa wursaka yega aggadis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu ha7i beyizayssi haathan xeelliza mala coo bozhibozhes shin he wode gidiko nu iza ayfeso lo7ethi beyana. Ta ha7i kumethi gidontta bagga xalala erayss. He wode gidiko ta ta hu7es erettida yssa mala erana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ammanoy, hidotayine siiqoy hayti heedzdzati eqi daana. Hayta wursofe adhizay siiqokko.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imotan bessiza mala go7eteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Siiqo kaallite; ayana imotethata harapeka tinbite hasa7iza imotata lo7ethi koyte. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hara qaalan hasa7izadey Xoossas attin asas hasa7ena. Xuura gidida yoo ayanan hasa7iza gishshi izi gizay asas gelena. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tinbite hasa7izadey asa minthethanas, denthethanasine go7anas hasa7es. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hara qaalan hasa7izadey qass berika bena minthethes. Tinbite hasa7izadey gidiko woossa keeththa go7es. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inte wurikka hara qaalan hasa7izako ta dosayiskko shin hessafeka bollara inte tinbite qaalan hasa7izako ta dosayss. Woossa keethay minnana mala hara qaalara hasa7izadey ba hasa7izayssa birshontta izi hara qaalara hasa7izayssafe tinbite hasa7izadey adhdhes. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta ishato ta inteko biza wode ta intes qonccisethan woykko eratethan woykko tinbiten, woykko timirtten yootontta hara qaalara yootiko hessi intena ay go7anee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessi coo susul7o malane diitha malati shempoy bayindaytika istta giirethas dumatethi shaaketi eretontta aggiko iza wostti eranee? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qasseka xurumbbay woykko zayey aazas zayettizakone shaaki eretontta ogera punettiko ooni olasi giigistanee? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inteka hessa malakko. Inte duunape erettiza qaalay kezontta aggiko inte gizayssa ooni eranee? Coo mela carkon dhayana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Alame bolla daro duma duma qaalay dees shin birshethi bayinda qaalay baawa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi issadey hasa7iza qaala birshechi ta erontta aggiko hasa7izades ta imathe gidayss. Izadeyka taas imathi gides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Inteka hessa mala ayanan imotethata demanas inte koyza gishshi woossa keeththa go7iza imoteth demanas lo7ethi koyte.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi hara qaalan hasa7iza uray ba hasa7idayssa birshechi erana mala bess woosso. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tani hara qaalara woossiza wode ta ayanan woossays attin ta izape aykoka erike. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Histin ta ay oothana mala taas bessizee? Tani ta ayananika woossana. Wozinan wothadaka woossana. Ta ayananika yexxana. Wozinaraka yexxana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessatho gidontta aggiko ne Xoossu ayanan galatiza wode hessa erontta issi imatha asi ne galata woossa wostti “Amin77i” gaanas danda7izee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ne bessiza mala galatanas danda7asa. Hankoyssi gidiko izan go7ettena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tani intefe bollara hara qaalan hasa7iza gishshi Xoossu galatayss. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gido attin woossa keeththan eretontta daro shi qaalata hasa7anape hara asata tamarssanas asay eriza ichchachu qaala hasa7ana dosayss. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte inte qofan guutha nayta mala gidopite. Iitta oothos gidiko guutha nayta mala gidite. Qofan gidiko kaha kunthida asata gidite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kase woganka “Istta qaalay imath gidida allaga asata qaalara ta hayssa asas yootana. Hessatho yootinka ta gizaz istti siyetena gees Goday” geeteti kase geesha maxaafan xaafetides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi hara qaalan hasa7ay ammanontta asas malata gides attin ammanizaytas malata gidena. Tinbite gidiko ammanizaytas attin ammanonttays gidena. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Histiko woossa keeththan ammaniza asay issife shiiqidason wurikka erontta hara qaalan hasa7ishin imatha asati woykko ammanontta asay, asay shiiqidi hasa7izaso geliko “Hayti goyeetes” geettenee? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Gido attin asay wuri tinbite qaala hasa7etishin imathi woykko ammanonttadey geliko ba siydayssan wurson minidatanane he qaalan piridistana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Izadey ba wozinan qotti wothidazi wuri qonccanane izika ba baggara “Tumape Xoossi intenara dees” giidi gufannidi Xoossas goynana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta ishato histin ay giinoo? Inte issife shiiqiza wode intefe issi issi uras yethi qasse issi issi uras timirttey dees. Issi issi qonccontta xuura miishata qonccisiza imotay dees. Hara uras duma qaalan hasa7ana imotay dees. Haras qasse he qaala birshecha imotay dees. Hessi he imotay wurikka ammanizayta go7anas besses. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hara qaalara hasa7izay diiko nam7u ura woykko dari dariko hedzdzu gididi taran taran yooteto. Hara uray qasse birsho. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Birshizadey bayinda aggiko shiiqida asa giddon co7u giidi bees xalalane Xoossas xalala yooto. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tinbite hasa7a imotay dizayti nabeti nam7ati woykko heedzdzati tinbite hasa7eto. Hanko asay yootetidayssa lo7ethi pacco. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Uttida asa garisafe issadey issi miishi qoncciko koyro hasa7izayssi co7u go. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Inte garisafe issi issi uray tamarana malane ministana mala inte wurikka taran taran tinbite yootanas danda7ista. <verse number="32-33" style="v"/>Nabista ayanay nabetas azazetes. Gaasoyka Xoossi sarotetha Xoossafe attin woccama Xoossu gidena. Ammanizayta woossa keeth wursosonka hessa malakko. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ammaniza asay goynos shiiqizason maccasati co7u geto. Muse wogay kase gida mala istti azazeteto attin shiiqoson istti hasa7ana mala isttas imettibeyna. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Maccashati eranas koyza issi issi yooti diiko ba keeththan ba azinata oycheto. Gaasoyka maccashi shiiqoson hasa7ay yeelachizazakko. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Xoossa qaalay intefe kezidee? Woyko inteko xalala gakkidee? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Oonka bena “Nabe” giiko woykko “Taas xiillo ayanape imotethi dees” gizadey diiko hayss ta intes xaafidayss Goda azazo gididayssa ero. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hayssa erontta uray diiko izi ba hu7es eretena. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta ishato, buro tinbite hasa7anas lo7eth koyite. Duma duma qaalan hasa7aka digopite. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Gidikoka wurikka maararane wogara gido.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristoosa dendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ha7ika ta ishato ta intena sabakin inte ekkidine izan minni eqqida mishiracho qaala ha7i qofisana koyays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta intes sabakida qaala inte lo7ethi oykkiko he mishiracho qaalan inte attana. Hessa mala gidontta aggiko inte ammanoy coo mela hadakko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tani taas ekkidayssane wursofe adhdhizayssa intes aatha imadis. Geesha maxaafati gizayssa mala Kiristoosay nu nagara gishshi hayqides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Moogettides; Geesha maxaafatan xaafettidayssa mala hedzdzantho gallas hayqope dendides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessafe kaallidi Phixirosas bettides. Qasseka Yesusa kaalliza tammane nam77atas bettides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessafe guye ichchachu xeetupe bollara diza ammanizaytas issito bettides. He iza be7ida asape dariza baggay paxa dees. Baggay qasse hayqqides <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yaqobes bettides. Kaallidika kumetha hawaristas bettides. <verse number="8-9" style="v"/>Tani hawarista wursofe guuthukko. Tani kase Xoossa woossa keeth goodida gishshi haware geetistanas ta bessonttadekko shin asa wursofe awucaya milatiza taasika bettides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gido attin Xoossa kiyatethan ha7i ta hanidayssa hanadis. Taasika imettida Xoossa kiyatethi mela hada gidibeyna. Tani oonapeka bollara daro minna oothadis. Gido attin hessa oothiday tana gidontta Xoossa aadho kiyatethi oothides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi tana gidin isttaka gidin nu wurikka sabakizay hessako. Inteka ammaniday hessako.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqope asa dendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kiristoosay hayqope dendidayssa nu tamarissiko histin inte garisafe issi issi asati waanidi hayqope dendoy baawa gizoo? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hayqida asas denthi donttaz gidiko Kiristoosayka dendibeyna guusakaa? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kirstoosayka hayqope dendonttaz gidiko nu sabakosu go7ay baawa. Inte ammanoyka co mela hadakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessafeka bollara Xoossi Kiristoosa hayqope denthides giidi nu marikatida marikayka nuna wordo Xoossa marikata kessideskaa? Hayqida asay hayqope dendonttaz gidiko Xoossi Kiristoosaka denthibeyna guusukko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gaasoyka hayqidayti dendonttazi gidiko Kiristoosayka hayqope dendibeyna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kiristoosay hayqope dendonttaz gidiko inte ammanoy coo melakko. Inteka hanno gakkanaas inte nagarara deista guusukko. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hanoy hessa mala gidiko Kiristoosa ammanid hayqidayti wurikka dhayida guusukko. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nuni Kiristoosan ufayss oothizay hanno biittay bolla duussas xalala gidiko nu asa wursofe lafatakko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gido attin Kiristoosay hayqidaytas wursos bayra gididi hayqope tumu dendides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hayqoy issi asa Addame baggara yida mala hayqidayta denthi Kiristoosa baggarakko. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Asi wurikka Addame baggara hayqida mala hessathoka asi wurikka Kiristoosa baggara hayqope dendana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gido attin wurikka ba tarara tarara dedana. Koyko bayra gidida Kristoosay dendides. Izape kaallidi izi yiza wode Kiristoosas gidizayti dendana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe guye haaretiza dereta, godatethine wolqamata wursi dhayssidape guye kawota Xoossa Aawas aathi immiza wode he wode wursethi gidana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Be morike wursika ba too garis aathana gakkanaas izi kawotanas besses. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Buro wursethan xooneti dhayana morkey hayqqokko. <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Xoossi wursika iza Godatethafe garisan wothides” gizazi geesha maxaafan xaafetides. Gido attin “Wurika iza Godatetha garisan gidides” gishin wurikka iza Godatetha garisan oothida Xoossa Aawa gujjonttako. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wurika izas haaretidayssafe guye Xoossi wursofe bolla gidana mala Xoossa nay qasse wursi bees haarisidayssas Xoossa Aawas haaristana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hayqope denthi doontta aggiko histin hayqida asa gishshi giidi xammaqetiza wursos go7ay aazee? Hayqidayti muleka dendonttaz gidiko histin asay istta gishshi aazas xammaqetizee? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nu qass wurso wode iitta metos aadhi imettizay aazasee? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ta ishato hachchi hachchi hayqoy tanara gaagees. Hessaka nu Goda Yesusa Kiristoosa geedon inte bolla diza ammanetethi ta intes qonccisays. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tani Efesonen do7a milatiza asatara baaxettidayssi asi beyana mala xalala gidiko taas izan aaza wodhey dizee? Hayqidaytas denthi dontta aggiko “Nu wontto hayqana gishshi ane moosu, ane uyossu” gizayta mala nuka istta mala gidosu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Inte balettofite “Iitta lagetethi, lo7o amalera dizayta moores.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wozinama gidite; nagara oothopite; Xoossu eronttayti issi issi asati inte garisan diza gishshi ta hessa intena yeelachanas gayss.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqope dendana asateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hayqidayti waani dendanee? Ay mala ashora dendanee? giza uray daana danda7es. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Neno, eeyazo! ne zeriza zerethay hayqontta dishe caarena. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Neni zeriza kaththa handaya gistte woykko hara kaththa ayfe gidikkoka guyepe ne ekkanara ha7i ne zeroro giduku. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Xoossi qasse ba koyda mala he zerethas iza mala medho immes. Zeretha qomotas issas issas iza milatiza asateth immes. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ashoy wurikka issi mala gidena. Asa ashoy issa gidishin mehe ashoy qasse harakko, Kafo ashoy harakko, mole ashoyka hara qommokko. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessa malaka salon dizaytaska istta milatiza medhoy dees. Biitta bolla dizaytaskka istta milatiza medhoy dees. Gido saloyta bonchoy issi malakko. Biitta bolla dizayta medho bonchoyka dummakko. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Awa arshe bonchoy issinokko. Gido attin agina bonchoy qasse dummakko. Xoolinttista bonchoyka harakko. Issi xoolintte bonchoy hara xoolintte bonchofe dummates.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hayqida asa denthika hessa malakko. Wooqiza medhoy zaretin wooqontta medhoy dendana. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kawushatethan zaretana shin bonchon dendana. Daburisan zaretana shin wolqama gididi dendana. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Medhetetha medhoy zaretana shin ayana medhoy dendana. Medhetetha medhoy diiko qasseka ayana medhoyka dees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi “Koyro asi Adamey deyoy diza medheteth gidides” geeteti geesha maxaafan xaafetides. Nam7antho Adame gidida Kiristoosay gidiko asas deyo immiza ayanakko. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Gido attin koyro yiday ayanayssa gidontta medhetethayssakko. Ayanayssi qass guyepe yidayssakko. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Koyro yida Adamey biittafe medhetida gishshi izi biittafekko. Nam7antho yiday salopekko. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Biittafe gididayti istti biittafe medhetidayssa malakko. Salope gididayti salope yidayssa malakko. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nuni biitta asa medha mayoyssathoka saloyssa medhaka mayana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ta ishato ta hayssa intes yootays ashoyne suuthi Xoossa kawotethi laattetena. Dhayanayssi dhayonttayssa laatena. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ane ta intes issi xuura yo yootayss. Nuni wurikka hayqqokko. Gido attin nu wurikka laamistana. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Hessika hananay nu qopontta dishin wursetha xurumbbay punettiza wode hessi qiphida ayfey xeeliza mala issi to hanana. Xurumbbay punistana; Hayqida asay wooqonttayta gididi dendana. Nunika laamistana. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Dhayzayssi dhayonttassa mayanas, hayqizay hayqonttayssa mayanas besses. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Dhayzay dhayonttaz, hayqizay hayqonttazi mayiza wode “Hayqoy xoonetti mitettides” geeteti kase geesha maxaafan xaafetida qaalay polettana. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hessaththoka “Hayqqo kase ne xoonoy awan dizee? Hayqo ne izara cadiza yiishay awan dizee?” <verse number="56" style="v"/>Hayqoy izara dukkiza wolqay nagarakko; Nagara wolqay wogakko. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Gido attin Goda Yesus Kiristoosa baggara nuusu xoono immiza Xoossas galatay gido. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta siiqo ishato minni eqite. Ay miishanka yariki yarikopite. Goda oothos inte daburiza daburisay hada gidonttayssa eridi wurso wode pacey bayinda Godas oothanas minettite.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalamen waayetiza ammanizaytas miisha keso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ha7i qasse ammanizaytas miisha keso gishshi Galatiyan diza woossa keethatas tani immida azazo mala inteka oothite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Miishay kezanay buro ta hee biin gidontta mala intefe issi issi uray bees diza mala saaminttan saaminttan issi gallas wogga wogga kessi wotho. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ta he biza wode inte doorida asatas ta moyzo dabidabe xaafa immada, istti inte immida imota Yerusalame gathana mala haape ta kiittana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta isttara baanas koshiza gidiko tanara bandetes.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawulosas oge baana qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tani bashe Maqidoniyara adha buussi attontta gishshi ta maqidonya gakkada heera inteko baana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ta awaka bishin tana ogey waaysontta mala inte tana maadana mala bashe ta inte achchan gam7ontta aggike. Oone erizay balgoy aadhana gakkanaas ta inte achchan balgoza athontta waaya aggana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ta inte achchan daro wode gam7anas koyiza gishshi intena coo ogera aadha bashe beyanas koyke. Goda shene gidiko inte achchan aduussa wode gam7anas koyays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido attin phenxxe-qosxe geetettiza ba7ale gallas gakkanaas ta Efesonen gam7ana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta heen gam7ana gaasoyka taasi gita ootho pengey doyettides shin tanara eqetizayti daroti deetes. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xiintoosay inteko biiko izi ta mala Goda oothancha gidida gishshi izi baboy bayinda daana mala inte iza maddite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi oonka iza kadhopo. Izi taako saron simmana mala inte maddiite. Nuka hara amanizaytara iza yuusa naagon doosu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu isha Aphilosay hara ammanizaytara inteko baana mala keeha woossadis shin izi qass ha7i inteko baanas koybeyna. Gido attin baana ogey giigishin izi inteko baana.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurisetha zorene saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Begite; ammanon minni eqqite; minnite; goobite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte oothizazi wursika siiqon oothite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta ishato, Akaya biittan koyro ammaniday Isixifanoseso asa gididayssane ammaniza asa maadanas istti bena aathi immidayssa inteka ererista. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Istta milatiza asatasine isttara issife daburiza asatas wursos azazistana mala ta intena woossays. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Isixifanosey, Ferdonaxosayne Akayqosay yida gishshi ta daro ufa7istayss. Gaasoyka inte haani tanara doontta gishshi istti taas pacizazi wursi kunthida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta wozinane inte wozina wursi shempisida. Hessa gishshi hessantta mala asata mule balopite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Isiya biittan diza woossa keethati intena saro geetes. Aqilayne Phirisiqilayka istta son shiiqiza ammaniza asay Goda sunthan boncho sarota intes shiishetes. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Haani ammanizayti wurikka intena saro geetes. Inte inte giddon issay issara siiqo yereteth yeretite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hayssa saroka ta kushera xaafiday tana Phawulossakko. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Goda dosontta uray diiko izi qangettidade gido! Godo haaya! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Goda Yesusa kiyateth intenara gido. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta siiqoy Goda Yesus Kiristoosa baggara intes wursos gido. Amin7i.</para>
</usx>
